@format 1
@id files.remove
@title Remove selected files
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Remove selected unlocked paths, repair current-row state, and notify tab lifecycle handlers when loaded media was removed.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related files.add, files.clear

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] Remove command <input>
- Receive the list Remove command @ list.PListRemove(...)
> selection

[selection] Read selection <decision>
- Read selected paths or fall back to the current row, then exclude rows already locked by accepted work @ list.PListRemove(...)
? "No unlocked path is selected" > unchanged
? "Unlocked paths are selected" > remove

[remove] Remove rows <process>
- Remove matching list items and rebuild visible rows @ list.PListPathsRemove(...)
- Repair selection, current path, and empty-state display @ list.PListPathsRemove(...)
- Publish the successfully removed paths for viewer and flow invalidation @ list.PListPathsRemove(...)
> result

[result] Files removed <output>
= Selected paths no longer participate; removing the loaded path also force-closes Preview and clears the tab flow.

[unchanged] List unchanged <output>
= No row is removed; locked submitted rows remain until the list is cleared.
